  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a  Dream Room in the  Pediatric Ward</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Dream Room is a space in the hospital( children&apos;s pediatric ward )where the foundation build or convert the space into a happy place where kids can go and feel better. The room  provide  children with simulation that they wouldn&apos;t necessarily get by lying in the hospital bed. This distraction although in hospital enable kids to leave the hospital ward and engage with educational activities such as Imaginary Play, Educational Games, Creative Crafts and Electronics Distractions.</narrative>
  </description>
